<section class="section-space page-wrap" id="story"><div class="intro-grid"><h2 class="display-heading reveal">Privacy, with <em>presence.</em></h2><div class="intro-copy reveal reveal-delay"><p>JIN’s private dining experience is imagined for guests who want the intimacy of the restaurant with a room held entirely for their company.</p><p>From a quiet dinner to a landmark celebration, the pace, menu, and service can be composed around the occasion.</p><a class="text-link" href="reservations.html">Discuss your evening <span>→</span></a></div></div><div class="mosaic"><figure class="mosaic-a reveal parallax-media"><img src="/assets/alcove.webp" alt="Private dining alcove in deep red" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1200" height="900"><figcaption>A room apart</figcaption></figure><figure class="mosaic-b reveal reveal-delay"><img src="/assets/sake.webp" alt="Sake carafe and ceramic cup" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1200" height="900"><figcaption>Pairings selected for the table</figcaption></figure><figure class="mosaic-c reveal"><img src="/assets/chawanmushi.webp" alt="Warm course in handmade ceramic" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1200" height="900"><figcaption>A menu shaped around the evening</figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section class="section-space page-wrap field-pale"><div class="private-features"><div class="reveal"><h2>Celebrations, <em>considered.</em></h2><p>Birthdays, anniversaries, proposals, and private hosting are approached with the same restraint as the menu. The details feel personal, while the room remains unmistakably JIN.</p></div><figure class="feature-image reveal reveal-delay parallax-media"><img src="/assets/private-hero.webp" alt="Private salon table set for an occasion" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1200" height="900"><figcaption>Private dining in Downtown Dubai</figcaption></figure></div><div class="private-features"><figure class="feature-image reveal parallax-media"><img src="/assets/experience-hero.webp" alt="Omakase counter during service" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1200" height="900"><figcaption>The counter may also be reserved for a full group</figcaption></figure><div class="reveal reveal-delay"><h2>The counter, <em>just for you.</em></h2><p>For the most immersive version of the experience, the entire counter can be imagined as a private stage: your guests, the chef, and the evening unfolding course by course.</p></div></div></section>
